  "project_description": "The jQueryUI filter converts static HTML to a jQuery UI accordion or tabs widget. Editors wrap heading/content HTML in [accordion] or [tabs] token markup inside a text-format-filtered field; the filter rewrites the tokens into <div data-ui-*> markup and the module's JavaScript builds the jQuery UI widget at render time. Because jQuery UI was removed from Drupal core, it depends on the contrib jquery_ui, jquery_ui_accordion and jquery_ui_tabs projects. Any jQuery UI accordion/tabs option can be passed as a token attribute (including JSON values). Widgets gracefully degrade to plain HTML when JavaScript is disabled or the page is printed.",
